 "status": "for the N64 in the one play host: its on-screen controls on a phone. The analogue stick is in \"sticks\" (kind stick, its axes into the port as a pad's left stick); until the site's overlay.js draws that kind, the eight-way pad of the group \"stick\" (fallbackFor: stick) stands in for it, full tilt on the arrows, and an overlay.js that knows the kind hides it. Laid out as the controller (26 Nov 2026): the stick in the centre at the foot, the D-pad's size, with Start centred above it (inFloat: the strip's Start gives way to this one while the pad shows; like every console's on-screen controls, they lie over the picture, 26 Nov 2026), the D-pad on the left level with A, B and the C buttons, L top left, R top right with Z under it",
